{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑くなって来ましたね!\n夏が近づいてる予感🐳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏にしたいことは、・海に行くこと\n・花火をすること・スイカを食べること・漫画を読むこと\nかなあ。\n最初の2つは、去年できなくて悔しかったこと!\n今年はしたいな〜🏖\nとりあえず、アニバを楽しんで清々しく夏を迎えようと思います(　-`ω-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、横浜での握手会で頂いたお花を載せますね!\n綺麗なお花、ありがとうございました🌷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYN8PT1VT4H6D3DWQVC8H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ピアノの発表会みたいな写真だ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYP84E9E81KK7DTKREWG7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">おっきい🎀とハート!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYQ8P6XVCZEX4Z7E346V2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">わー、きゅうり🥒"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYR73TPNAB3PFEJRBSS3W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">カラフルすごいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYS73A0T4TXF1DE2FWJXX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">鳥がいる🐥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYT5HAVEMAHSQ89RV92AH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">かすみ草だー!好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYV6R9HY6PE54QM13FXQW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">美味しそう🍅"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNYW56AR0SB3BS5K9SCM8G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ななこ風船🎈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないつもありがとう〜令和もよろしくね!\n令和は健康に気をつけて、アイスクリームから果実系のアイスに少し切り替えていこうと思ってます🍇\nラクトアイスから始めよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}